title: "Touchstone Benchmark: large-scale evaluation of AI algorithms for medical segmentation"
abstract: "Code, leaderboard and evaluation protocol for the Touchstone Benchmark, a large-scale multi-center evaluation of AI algorithms for abdominal organ segmentation in CT."
